      "questions": [
        {"id": "GH010044_Q01", "text": "请问你一般把牛奶放在那", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "object", "c": "C1", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q02", "text": "左边右边，还是都可以", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "spatial", "c": "C4", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q03", "text": "其他的，比如说水果之类的，一般会放在哪呢", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "object", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q04", "text": "就这里吗（用手指）", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "spatial", "c": "C4", "q": "Q1"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q05", "text": "那一些其他的吃的，比如零食、面等会放在哪", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "object", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q06", "text": "你觉得我这样摆得可以吗（指右侧门边）", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "spatial", "c": "C4", "q": "Q1"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q07", "text": "你不太喝可乐是吗", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K11", "referent": "user", "c": "C1", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q08", "text": "其他的呢，像这些呢（指其他饮料）", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "object", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q09", "text": "那我收拾成这样，你觉得满意吗", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K11", "referent": "user", "c": "C4", "q": "Q1"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q10", "text": "这个药在里边藏着，刚刚没发现，你觉得这个药需要放在哪里", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "spatial", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044_Q11", "text": "这个抽屉里还有东西", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "spatial", "c": "C3", "q": "Q1"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "dyad_id": "GH010044!!",
      "n_questions": 10,
      "notes": "Q01 coded K11/user/C1/Q2 in original but semantically asks about organising preference — possible coding inconsistency vs C4/Q14. Include in IRR.",
      "questions": [
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q01", "text": "你一般习惯怎么整理冰箱，是按照饮料偏好吗，还是盒子类型来整理", "phase": "pre-task", "k": "K11", "referent": "user", "c": "C1", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q02", "text": "一层放酒，一层放饮料是吗？", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "other", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q03", "text": "物品优先放在哪个区域", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "other", "c": "C1", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q04", "text": "水果的话放在上面还是下面呢", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "other", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q05", "text": "牛奶是放在饮料的下面还是上面", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "other", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q06", "text": "那已经开封的食品放在哪里呢", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "other", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q07", "text": "那这层我放没有开封的，这层放已经开封的可以吗", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "other", "c": "C3", "q": "Q1"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q08", "text": "冰箱两侧放酒跟饮料，下面的话我尽量给你码得整齐一点", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "other", "c": "C3", "q": "Q2"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q09", "text": "只要开封了我就放第一层，可以吧", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K5", "referent": "user", "c": "C4", "q": "Q1"},
        {"id": "GH010044!!_Q10", "text": "这样可以吗", "phase": "during-task", "k": "K11", "referent": "user", "c": "C4", "q": "Q1"}
      ]
    },
